{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "13f5942c93e8d83f4b411851be55fa5c0c93d935f18f524714368a8a30bfcc07", "ja": "あの、ね、{$P$}さん……。\nこの前の、お芝居……不思議に思った、の……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……\n之前演的戏……杏奈觉得，很不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1001_p", "source_sha256": "25b1fadc6a36b6fdea5ccf55e1458bb3c541268cfc48793d46d1bd288272808d", "ja": "不思議？　なにがだ？", "zh": "不可思议？你是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "e975afcd06329c5553779fd90a829d0072eac4d3701df19690647380d54d3c78", "ja": "一番最初に、やった役……スイッチオフのときの、\n杏奈みたいで……上手にできたとは、思う、けど……。", "zh": "一开始演的角色……就像是私底下的\n杏奈……感觉演得，还算不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "f27fff2c93f2041d6dc02d8d9c75d1a9add8d0b920e25181591ceb582e5a6422", "ja": "ファンのみんな……喜んで、くれる……？\n元気いっぱいの、杏奈じゃ、ないのに……？", "zh": "但粉丝们……会开心吗……？\n看到那个不是活力充沛的杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b3471f3b8df487d33074cca2ed25e87f9f2b9434bafbcca5d5aa42a5bb0ac847", "ja": "心配いらないよ。オフの杏奈もかわいいって、みんなに\n見せてあげたかったから、あの仕事を受けたんだ。", "zh": "不用担心啦，我就是因为想让大家知道\n私底下的杏奈也很可爱，才接下那份工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "9583020a160a4a8fb9b90e18d62a11245535f8654ba7e26c3d63c5d0f8058a00", "ja": "か、かわいい……？　今の、杏奈が……？　そ、そんな\nことない……と思うから、恥ずかしい……けど……。", "zh": "可、可爱……？你说，现在的杏奈……？\n杏、杏奈不这么觉得……所以，好害羞……但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0032_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "7214e66f48b889167a7b6fa5d4da949c4a80e77e7a2ec79eb6906b059c0d029b", "ja": "{$P$}さんが……そう言って、\nくれるのは……うれしい、よ。…………ありがとう。", "zh": "可以……听到{$P$}先生这么说……\n杏奈很高兴喔…………谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
